{"id":"g2104","title":"Arnica/Stannum (ext.)","description":"Lokale Anwendung bei Schwellung und Schmerz im Rahmen von Arthritis und Tendinitis auf der Grundlage von Arthrose, rheumatoider Arthritis oder Trauma.","blocks":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hersteller"}]},{"type":"text","text":": WELEDA NL; Rezepturpräparat. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Zusammensetzung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Arnika, Planta tota 15 %; Stannum metallicum 2,5 %. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Indikationen"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"indication","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Schwellung und Schmerz bei Arthritis und Tendinitis "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1827","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Auf der Grundlage von Arthrose, rheumatoider Arthritis oder Trauma. "}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Erwachsene: 1–2 x tgl. die betroffenen Gelenke einreiben. "},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Kinder: < 2 J. 1 x tgl. einreiben, > 2 J. 1–2 x tgl. einreiben."}]}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Nach 1 Wo. sind Schmerzreduktion und Rückgang der Schwellung zu beobachten. Wenn nach 6 Wo. keine Besserung der Beschwerden eintritt, sollte die Therapie umgestellt werden. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Akut 1 Wo., bei chronischen Beschwerden Monate. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Nebenwirkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Keine. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": In Deutschland kann die Salbe gemischt werden aus "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0092.html","id":"10308","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Arnika (ext.)"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 30 % Salbe WELEDA und "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0421.html","id":"10309","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Stannum metallicum (ext.)"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 5 % Salbe WELEDA. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtende Ärztin"}]},{"type":"text","text":": MWi. "}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}